					"speakerTitle": "希爾米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390402,
					"content": "恭…恭喜你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230390404,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，我說了很擅長跑步的，{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}難道是輕敵了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希爾米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390405,
					"content": "不過，就算是跑這麼快，哈巴奇哥哥還是會抓住我們，到底是為什麼呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390406,
						230390407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧貝德"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390406,
					"content": "也許是抄了近路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230390408,
					"content": "是這樣嗎？唔…但是這周圍好像也沒什麼近路啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧貝德"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390409,
					"content": "#不然，我們下次請{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}來陪我們玩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希爾米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390410,
					"content": "陪我們訓練！那個…訓練那個「野外匿蹤」吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希爾米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390411,
					"content": "對喔，既然跑不過哈巴奇哥哥，那我們就繞開他…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧貝德"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390412,
					"content": "我們之前不都繞過了嗎？但是無論如何都會被哈巴奇哥哥發現的啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "希爾米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390407,
					"content": "也許是有什麼訣竅…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230390403,
